# Indian Fabric Glossary

A simple, open reference for the fabrics, embroidery styles and buying terms used in Indian bridal and festive wear.

It is meant for designers, students, developers building fashion or e-commerce tools, and anyone shopping for fabric for the first time. Each entry explains what the term means, how the fabric feels and where it is commonly used.

Maintained by the team at [Paras Gallery Fabrics](https://parasgalleryfabrics.com/), a fabric retail and wholesale house in Lajpat Nagar II, New Delhi.

