## Base fabrics

| Fabric | Feel | Drape | Common uses |
|---|---|---|---|
| Georgette | Light, slightly grainy | Fluid, flowing | Lehengas, anarkalis, sarees, dupattas |
| Chiffon | Very light, smooth, sheer | Soft, airy | Dupattas, sarees, overlays |
| Chinon | Soft with a slight sheen | Smooth | Festive suits, dupattas |
| Organza | Crisp, sheer | Holds shape, adds volume | Lehenga skirts, dupattas, sleeves |
| Tissue | Sheer with metallic threads | Light, shimmering | Dupattas, sarees, festive layers |
| Net | Open mesh, light | Airy, layered | Layered lehengas, dupattas |
| Raw silk | Textured, soft sheen | Structured | Blouses, jackets, sherwanis |
| Dupion silk | Crisp, with visible slubs | Structured | Kurtas, blouses, menswear |
| Satin | Smooth and glossy | Fluid | Gowns, linings, reception wear |
| Crepe | Fine pebbly texture | Smooth, crease-resistant | Sarees, gowns, fusion wear |
| Velvet | Thick, soft pile | Heavy, rich | Winter lehengas, jackets, shawls |
| Banarasi brocade | Heavy, woven pattern | Structured | Bridal lehengas, sarees |
| Jacquard | Woven pattern, varied weights | Medium | Suits, jackets |
| Cotton | Breathable, soft | Medium | Haldi outfits, kurtas, daywear |

