## Buying terms

| Term | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Running fabric | Fabric sold by the metre from a roll |
| Panel | A section with a design placed for a specific garment part |
| Border | A decorative strip along the fabric edge |
| Width | Edge-to-edge measurement of the fabric; affects metres needed |
| Dye lot | A batch dyed together; colours can vary between lots |
| Lining | Inner fabric layer for comfort and structure |
| Unstitched set | Pre-cut matching fabrics for one outfit |
| Swatch | A small sample used to check colour and feel before buying |

