## Fabric by occasion

| Occasion | Fabrics often chosen |
|---|---|
| Haldi | Cotton, georgette, chinon |
| Mehendi | Georgette, organza, printed and mirror-work fabrics |
| Sangeet | Georgette, net, tissue, sequinned fabrics |
| Engagement | Organza, crepe, silk satin |
| Wedding ceremony | Banarasi brocade, silk, velvet, embroidered net |
| Reception | Satin, tissue, velvet, embroidered organza |

These are common choices, not rules. Season, time of day and personal comfort matter just as much.

